2.1.1 Recommended Benchmark Parameter Practical Considerations: While this section 2.1 provides specific ranges, real-world scenarios often require balancing trade-offs between different factors. Parameter Recommended Range Importance Rainfall 2000-3000 mm Provides essential moisture for tree hydration and supports healthy flowering and fruiting.
Temperature 27°C - 32°C Ensures consistent growth;

